 (5) For a powered-lift category rating:
 (i) Preflight preparation;
 (ii) Preflight procedures;
 (iii) Airport and heliport operations;
 (iv) Hovering maneuvers;
 (v) Takeoffs, landings, and go-arounds;
 (vi) Performance maneuvers;
